{
  "name": "cli-sessions-settings",
  "about": "连 gateway 的只读 / 设置命令：先用 ws 造一个会话，再用 CLI 的 sessions list（缺省子命令、--project）、sessions messages（存在 / 不存在的会话）、错 token 被拒、settings get、settings set（允许的字段写进 pilotdeck.yaml、不允许的字段被拒、非对象被拒）。CLI 的 token 只认 --auth-token / PILOTDECK_SDK_AUTH_TOKEN / PILOTDECK_TOKEN / server-token 文件（src/cli/sdkCli.ts:185-188），不认场景默认的 PILOTDECK_GATEWAY_TOKEN，所以每步给 PILOTDECK_TOKEN；地址走 PILOTDECK_GATEWAY_PORT（sdkCli.ts:184）。 有会话时的 sessions list 输出里 lastModified 是文件 mtime（src/session/storage/SessionList.ts:145），基线两次运行必然不同，放在 cli-sessions-list 场景里单独比。",
  "env": {
    "PILOTDECK_TOKEN": "{TOKEN}"
  },
  "provider": [
    {
      "name": "title",
      "when": [
        "Generate a concise title"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "{\"title\": \"Say hello\"}"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "main",
      "reply": {
        "text": "Hello from the mock."
      }
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "cli": [
        "sessions"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ws": "submit_turn",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-bbx-1",
        "channelKey": "test",
        "message": "hello"
      }
    },
    {
      "sleep": 500
    },
    {
      "cli": [
        "sessions",
        "list",
        "--project",
        "{PROJECT}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cli": [
        "sessions",
        "list",
        "--project",
        "{ROOT}/nowhere"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cli": [
        "sessions",
        "messages",
        "s-bbx-1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cli": [
        "sessions",
        "messages",
        "s-missing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cli": [
        "sessions",
        "list",
        "--project",
        "{ROOT}/nowhere",
        "--auth-token",
        "{TOKEN}"
      ],
      "env": {
        "PILOTDECK_TOKEN": null
      }
    },
    {
      "cli": [
        "sessions",
        "list"
      ],
      "env": {
        "PILOTDECK_TOKEN": "wrong"
      }
    },
    {
      "cli": [
        "settings"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cli": [
        "settings",
        "get"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cli": [
        "settings",
        "set",
        "{\"agent\":{\"maxOutputTokens\":4096}}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cli": [
        "settings",
        "set",
        "--json",
        "{\"tools\":{\"webSearch\":{\"enabled\":false}}}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cli": [
        "settings",
        "set",
        "{\"provider\":{\"x\":1}}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cli": [
        "settings",
        "set",
        "[1,2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cli": [
        "settings",
        "set",
        "{\"agent\":",
        "{\"maxContextTokens\":",
        "null}}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cli": [
        "settings",
        "get"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
